  "prompt": "What is the deadline for the individual annual income tax return?",
  "runtimeCommit": "ba08ae790021ac1e22f438a82372a643dd886de0",
  "answer": "### Short Answer\nThe deadline for filing the individual annual income tax return in the Philippines is April 15 of the following year after the taxable year.\n\n### Interpretation\n\n### Practical Meaning\nTaxpayers should ensure that they prepare and submit their income tax returns by April 15 to avoid penalties and interest for late filing. It is advisable to keep track of income and expenses throughout the year to facilitate timely and accurate filing.",
